OHOS: point HOME at the app's writable files directory, and skip the login-shell
PATH probe. os.homedir() resolves to the user's home, which the app sandbox
cannot write; fix-path forks the login shell from the Node main thread, which
deadlocks libuv on OHOS before the first window is created.

